WEBVTT

00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:02.356
They don't address root causes
of the climate crisis,

00:08:02.396 --> 00:08:07.796
and they don't reduce emissions
at the rate that we need now either.

00:08:08.276 --> 00:08:09.756
Let me be clear,

00:08:09.796 --> 00:08:12.596
making money off of the climate crisis ...

00:08:13.596 --> 00:08:15.076
That isn't innovative.

00:08:15.436 --> 00:08:17.156
It's not new

00:08:17.196 --> 00:08:20.076
and it's not going to lead
to the kind of effective solutions

00:08:20.076 --> 00:08:22.036
we need to solve this crisis.

00:08:22.636 --> 00:08:25.436
And I'm not talking
from a moral perspective,

00:08:25.436 --> 00:08:28.876
I'm talking from an on-the-ground,
practical perspective.

00:08:29.676 --> 00:08:33.076
Because this crisis, climate change,